# The root (Glama) image's build context is the whole checkout, and the image copies only controller/app,
# controller/requirements.txt, controller/constraints.txt and scripts/glama_entrypoint.sh. Kept out of what the build
# is sent: .git, .venv*, node_modules, __pycache__, the runtime data (data/ holds the API token and the keys) and
# .env* files.
.git
**/.venv*
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
data
**/.env*
